  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vcard\" style=\"width: 22em\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" class=\"n\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 125%\"><span class=\"fn\">Estela La Riva</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/f/f3/Estela_La_Riva_Blank.png/revision/latest?cb=20170805164348\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/f/f3/Estela_La_Riva_Blank.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/265?cb=20170805164348\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"265\" height=\"322\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Estela La Riva Blank.png\" data-image-key=\"Estela_La_Riva_Blank.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:110%;\"><hr /><div style=\"background:lavender;\"><a href=\"/wiki/President_of_the_United_States\" title=\"President of the United States\">60th</a>&#160;President of the United States</div>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-bottom:none; text-align:center;\"><b>In&#160;office</b><br />January 20, 2105&#160;&#8211;&#160;January 20, 2109\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Vice&#160;President\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Miriam_Weinstein\" title=\"Miriam Weinstein\">Miriam Weinstein</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Preceded&#160;by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Tom_Steele\" title=\"Tom Steele\">Tom Steele</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Succeeded&#160;by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Stewart_M._Li\" title=\"Stewart M. Li\">Stewart M. Li</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Born\n</th>\n<td>2055<br />Arizona\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Nationality\n</th>\n<td>American\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<th>Political&#160;party\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Progress_Party_(United_States)\" title=\"Progress Party (United States)\">Progress</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Profession\n</th>\n<td>Civil Servant<br />Politician\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th>Religion\n</th>\n<td>Roman Catholicism\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Estela La Riva was the 60th President of the United States serving from 2105 to 2109. She was the first president to be elected and fully served in the 22nd century.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Presidency\">Presidency</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEstela_La_Riva%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Chinese_Civil_War\"><b>Chinese Civil War</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FEstela_La_Riva%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/Third_Chinese_Civil_War\" title=\"Third Chinese Civil War\">Third Chinese Civil War</a></i>\nLa Riva took office at the start of the Chinese Civil War and was responsible for the American peace keeping mission to Beijing. What was originally a very popular decision grew out of favor with the public and by the 2108 elections, La Riva took much of the blame for China's dissolution and the loss of so much of the country to Mexican influence.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205636\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time u